{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features a short prototype, showcasing the main characteristics of the final game: turn-based combat, high difficulty, and a glimpse of the story and themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edenwound</strong> is a dungeon crawler rpg with roguelike elements and a high level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths of <strong>Eden</strong>, a mysterious abyss filled with corrupted explorers and abominations. Fight, manage resources, and survive as you push deeper with each expedition. <br>What lies at the bottom of <strong>Eden</strong>? And how did this cursed place come to be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>brutal difficulty</strong>: every mistake can cost your life</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>roguelike</strong> elements: items, equipment, and more that change with each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-color palette</strong>\u00a0featuring cold cerulean tones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compatible with controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >steam deck compatible</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890260?t=1759586819","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890260?t=1759586819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890260/17031d7ab828c168ce988f392df73b4e7f2c870e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759586819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890260/17031d7ab828c168ce988f392df73b4e7f2c870e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759586819"